<title>DUBAI: Kuwait leaves July propane, butane unchanged - KPC.</title>
<headline>Kuwait leaves July propane, butane unchanged - KPC.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) has set its July liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) prices at an unchanged $175 a tonne for propane and an unchanged $192 a tonne for butane, KPC said on Monday.</p>
</text>
